Adds IOCTL_UPDATE_VIRTUAL_DISPLAY_MODE (protocol 0.3): sets a monitor's preferred mode and rebuilds its target modes
with IddCxMonitorUpdateModes (IddCxMonitorUpdateModes2 when the HDR callbacks are in use), so a resize keeps the same
monitor instead of adding a new one and removing the old.
Applies to SudoVDA at the commit in ../UPSTREAM with `git apply` (build.ps1, run by .github/workflows/sudovda.yml).
The text below is a diff of SudoVDA's own files, which stay under their licences (see ../UPSTREAM).

